sequenceDiagram
  participant Phone
  participant API
  participant Bedrock
  participant AgntID
  participant MCP as Private MCP connector
  participant Shopify
  Phone->>API: Submit quote request with client_request_id
  API-->>Phone: 202 with persisted turn ID
  Phone->>API: Subscribe to owned turn events
  API->>AgntID: Open authenticated task using verified SDK
  API->>Bedrock: Message and reviewed tool definitions
  Bedrock-->>API: Complete structured create_quote proposal
  API->>AgntID: Tool call plus trusted execution context
  alt Allowed 200 basis points
    AgntID->>MCP: Forward reviewed tool invocation
    MCP->>MCP: Verify context and persist operation
    MCP->>Shopify: Fixed draftOrderCreate mutation
    Shopify-->>MCP: Draft ID and totals
    MCP-->>AgntID: Validated quote result
    AgntID-->>API: Tool result
    API-->>Phone: Persisted quote_created event
  else Denied 1200 basis points
    AgntID-->>API: Actual policy denial
    Note over MCP,Shopify: No invocation or mutation
    API-->>Phone: Runtime denial event
  end
  API->>Bedrock: Matching tool result or denial
  Bedrock-->>API: Explanation or permitted alternative
  API->>AgntID: Close task
